<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/11/msa@/~cl_4__para_e> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "e" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/11/msa@> .
